    "signature": "fn parse_sql_predicate_to_kernel(predicate: impl AsRef<str>, table_schema: &delta_kernel::schema::StructType, session: &dyn Session) -> DeltaResult<delta_kernel::expressions::Predicate>",
    "docs": "Parse a SQL predicate string into a kernel [`Predicate`] for file skipping\nduring log replay.\n\nThe predicate is resolved against the table's logical schema, coercing\nliterals to the referenced column types the same way operation predicates\n(delete, update, merge) are resolved. Only constructs the kernel can\nevaluate against file-level metadata are accepted.",
